## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6 Astra
- **Short description:** OpenAI's latest flagship model, successor to GPT-5/GPT-5.5, top-tier in coding, reasoning, and knowledge work across the benchmark set. Positioned for professional daily use.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API (`openai/gpt-6-astra`); OpenRouter `openai/gpt-6-astra`. Chat Completions API only (no Responses API). Available on OpenAI Platform and via OpenRouter routing.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026 (exact date pending confirmation; believed late 2026). Knowledge cutoff: vendor-published only.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-6-astra`; API key format: `sk_...`. No Responses-API variant.
- **Context window:** Native ~1,050,000 tokens (~1M). One of the largest context windows in the current frontier. Confirmed by OpenRouter provider page.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out only. Tool calling supported. Reasoning on by default, turnable off. Image understanding available via separate multimodal GPT interface but not separately priced on standard API.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** $10.00/M input tokens, $50.00/M output tokens on OpenRouter. Premium pricing among frontier models.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI. Not open weights. Built on internal architecture with MoE components.

